{"name":"Kai Companion","dev":"Ka.I Health GmbH","keys":["ios:6756260239"],"ios":{"id":"6756260239","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/kai-companion/id6756260239?uo=4","rating":0,"ratings":0,"price":"$29.99","genre":"Lifestyle","screens":["https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/c0/49/09/c04909b2-3b34-2a3f-90df-292c52195165/01__U2014_Hero__U0028Dunkelblau_U0029.jpg/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/28/e6/d8/28e6d875-af2f-9c1e-73bc-8ff7d15053f1/02__U2014_Hilfekette__U0028Hell_U0029.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/89/ee/44/89ee445f-e2f6-2876-adb9-a24d4985f9aa/03__U2014_Kontakte.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/a4/da/6e/a4da6e2d-0bd8-754a-b145-8eb92f16965c/04__U2014_Tools.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/f6/e8/da/f6e8da25-06ea-c9cf-810f-f2921daf16f9/05__U2014_Kai_als_Begleiter.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/a9/e7/c4/a9e7c434-8736-1d83-a752-1d68f6121574/06__U2014_Sprachbefehl__U0028Hell_U0029.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/e4/a3/a3/e4a3a359-cbba-96b6-728e-fdc3f2a23b52/07_-_Sperrbildschirm.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/89/95/aa/8995aa06-99e3-cd1c-c607-1e556f8f808d/09__U2014_Gesundheit__U0026_Sicherheit__U0028Hell_U0029.png/320x480bb.jpg"],"desc":"Kai does one thing, and does it properly: get you help fast.\n\nOne tap on the safety chain and Kai sends your trusted contacts a message with your current location, so they know where you are. Then Kai calls them one after another. If the first doesn't pick up, Kai dials the next after 20 seconds, and keeps going until someone answers.\n\nStart the safety chain whichever way suits the moment:\n\n• straight from the app\n• from the widget on your Lock Screen\n• hands-free with \"Hey Siri, Bravo\"\n\nSet it up once and it's done. Kai walks you through it: add your trusted contacts, put them in order, switch on the shortcut. After that it's a single tap.\n\nKai has no account and no cloud. Your contacts stay on your iPhone, and your location only goes out when you start the safety chain.\n\nKai is a supporting tool and is not a replacement for official emergency services.","released":"2025-12-31","updated":"2026-09-17","icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/6e/9a/6c/6e9a6cef-a036-9364-c7b1-3cf80082763e/KaiLogo-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-1-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","age":"17+"},"android":null,"icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/6e/9a/6c/6e9a6cef-a036-9364-c7b1-3cf80082763e/KaiLogo-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-1-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","cat":"Lifestyle","rating":null,"ratings":0,"mentions":1,"users":1,"threads":1,"hn_points":2,"hn_comments":2,"submissions":1,"self_n":0,"hn_score":5.17,"first":1776670125,"last":1776670125,"show_hn":null,"n_lab":1,"pos_pct":0,"neg_pct":0,"mood":null,"quotes":[{"id":47831321,"k":"ios:6756260239","type":"story","by":"Ilja_Gr","time":1776670125,"text":"","title":"Safety Companion App","story_id":47831321,"story_title":"Safety Companion App","story_score":2,"comments":2,"w":4.17,"u":0,"s":"neu","self":false}],"slug":"kai-companion"}